        {
          "t": "heading",
          "level": 1,
          "text": "Myopia Control for Children in Pine Beach",
          "html": "Myopia Control for Children in Pine Beach&nbsp;",
          "id": "tlS613GMNE",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>Does your child’s prescription seem to be changing every year? Myopia, or nearsightedness, is becoming more common in kids, especially with increased screen time and less time outdoors.</p><p>The good news is, there are ways to slow it down. At <a href=\"/hours-location/\">Academy Vision</a>, we focus on more than just helping your child see clearly—we work to protect their vision for the future.</p>",
          "id": "N46tpPbPB4",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
