      "nodes": [
        {
          "t": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Why Myopia Management Is Important",
          "html": "Why Myopia Management Is Important",
          "id": "IA3uzMCig2",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>Glasses can help your child see clearly, but they don’t stop myopia from getting worse. As prescriptions increase, so does the risk of developing more severe <a href=\"/eye-care-services/eye-disease-management/\">eye conditions</a> later in life.</p><p>By starting treatment early, we can help slow that progression and reduce those risks, giving your child a better chance at long-term eye health.</p>",
          "id": "BswQw2uVUS",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
