        {
          "t": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "A Personalized Myopia Plan for Your Child",
          "html": "A Personalized Myopia Plan for Your Child",
          "id": "PpUifYP5n6",
          "col": 1,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>Every child is different, and their treatment should be too. We take the time to evaluate your child’s vision, lifestyle, and the rate at which their prescription is changing. From there, we’ll walk you through your options and help you choose a plan that fits your family. You’ll never feel rushed or overwhelmed—just informed and supported.</p>",
          "id": "48Vg7hEyHu",
          "col": 1,
          "origin": "static"
        },
