      "nodes": [
        {
          "t": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Our Myopia Treatments",
          "html": "Our Myopia Treatments",
          "id": "4FrIXtj3bJ",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>Once we understand your child’s vision, we’ll recommend options that are designed to slow progression. These may include:</p><ul><li><strong>Ortho-k (overnight lenses)</strong> that gently reshape the eye while your child sleeps, so they can see clearly during the day without glasses or contacts.</li><li><strong>Soft contact lenses</strong> designed specifically for kids to help control how light enters the eye and slow prescription changes.</li><li><strong>Atropine eye drops</strong> that are easy to use at home and help reduce how quickly myopia progresses.</li><li><a href=\"/eyeglasses/stellest-lenses/\"><strong>Myopia control glasses</strong></a> with specialized lenses that support clearer vision while helping manage long-term changes.</li></ul>",
          "id": "LJBcPuENxp",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "image",
          "master": "https://cdn.patientengage.cloud/sites/e752392a-0da3-46cc-8c49-9c11718cae49/live/media/019d4a87-a98c-7028-9aa1-f912e39d46da/AdobeStock_648663168.jpeg",
