        {
          "t": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "What the Myopia Process Looks Like",
          "html": "What the Myopia Process Looks Like",
          "id": "X6uob8uIAX",
          "col": 1,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>Getting started is easier than you might think. We begin with a <a href=\"/eye-care-services/comprehensive-eye-exams/\">comprehensive eye exam</a> to understand your child’s vision and how it’s changing. From there, we’ll talk through the best options and create a plan tailored to their needs. As your child grows, we’ll continue to monitor their progress and make adjustments along the way.</p>",
          "id": "Pds0govyII",
          "col": 1,
          "origin": "static"
        },
