          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>If you’ve noticed your child’s vision changing, it’s worth taking a closer look. We’ll walk you through everything, answer your questions, and help you decide what makes the most sense moving forward. Give us a call or schedule your visit—we’ll take it from there.</p>",
